the target language is: lps.

% Inform's test C9SceneEndSequence, in Logical English. See scene.lps.

the maximum time is 6.

the events are:
    the command is to take *a thing*; known as cmd_take.

the actions are:
    *a person* takes *a thing*; known as take.
    *a note* is said; known as say.

the fluents are:
    *a thing* is in *a place*; known as in.
    *a person* carries *a thing*; known as carries.
    *a scene* is playing; known as playing.
    *a scene* has ended *a way*; known as ended.
    *a note* has been said; known as said.

the knowledge base scene includes:

initially cube is in home
    and ball is in home
    and player is in home
    and starting is playing.

% the command parser is a rule: a typed command becomes an action if it can
if the command is to take a thing from a first time to a second time
    and the thing is in a place at the second time
    and player is in the place at the second time
then player takes the thing from the second time to a third time.

when a person takes a thing
then the person carries the thing.

when a person takes a thing
then it is not the case that the thing is in a place.

when a note is said
then the note has been said.

% you can't take what you already carry
it must not be true that
    a person takes a thing from a first time to a second time
    and the person carries the thing at the first time.

% "Starting ends roundly when the player carries the ball"
if starting is playing at a time
    and player carries ball at the time
then terminate starting is playing from the time to a second time
    and initiate starting has ended roundly from the time to the second time.

if starting is playing at a time
    and player carries cube at the time
then terminate starting is playing from the time to a second time
    and initiate starting has ended squarely from the time to the second time.

% "Ending begins when Starting ends. When Ending begins: say how"
if starting has ended a way at a time
    and it is not the case that ending is playing at the time
then initiate ending is playing from the time to a second time
    and the way is said from the time to the second time.

scenario one is:
    the command is to take ball from 2 to 3.
